  "title": "TENDERD Launches with MENA’s Largest Seed Round of $5.8m",
  "summary": "TENDERD, a heavy equipment rental marketplace for the construction industry in the MENA region, announced today the region’s largest seed funding round of $5.8 million from a spectrum of high profile San Francisco and international investors. Leading the funding round is Y Combinator and BECO and also includes Paul Graham, Peter Thiel, Paul Buchheit, Justin […]",
